{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36569","headline":"送章碣赴举 · 罗隐","name":"送章碣赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苹鹿歌中别酒催，粉闱星彩动昭回。\n久经罹乱心应破，乍覩昇平眼渐开。\n顾我昔年悲玉石，怜君今日蕴风雷。\n龙门盛事无因见，费尽黄金老隗台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}